# `view.enter_edit_mode`

Grant the session view-edit mode for a view.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.views.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `view` | `string` | yes |
| `session_id` | `string` | yes |

## Returns

Status JSON (the mutation result).

## Invoke

```
ship ops call view.enter_edit_mode --json '{ "view": "", "session_id": "" }'
```

Kind: command.
